# Agent Homebase

Before coding in `bakery/`, run `php scripts/agent_homebase.php brief --agent=<mission> --json` and follow `.cursor/skills/agent-homebase/SKILL.md` plus `docs/AGENT_DEVELOPMENT_MANUAL.md`. Use the packed `mission_packet`; do not re-read archived docs.

During work, pin decisions (`--column=decided` for lasting ones) and log durable bugs. Do not leave those only in chat.

End every session with a numbered §10 handoff. Completing exception *work* never hides a still-true operational fact. Craft ledger is `bakerysf_stage_local`. Tests wipe `bakerysf_test`. Staging auto-push must never target `bakery.sourflour.org/bake`.
